WEBVTT

00:00:00.302 --> 00:00:01.821
I keep my lessons in a notebook,

00:00:01.841 --> 00:00:03.361
and at the end of the month

00:00:03.381 --> 00:00:05.901
I don't know who has paid me.

00:00:06.222 --> 00:00:09.260
Log in with your email and password to open your ledger.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.764
Your lessons and payments are all in one place.

00:00:13.087 --> 00:00:16.022
Your monthly summary shows lessons given, money collected,

00:00:16.042 --> 00:00:17.501
and money still pending,

00:00:17.521 --> 00:00:21.089
so you always know where you stand.

00:00:21.411 --> 00:00:24.141
After each lesson, record the student, the date,

00:00:24.161 --> 00:00:26.547
how long it ran, and the price.

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:28.578
It takes seconds.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.138
The pending payments list shows every lesson that is still unpaid.

00:00:32.158 --> 00:00:35.510
When a student pays, mark it as paid.

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:38.231
Back on the summary, pending money has dropped

00:00:38.251 --> 00:00:39.743
and collected money has grown.

00:00:39.763 --> 00:00:42.557
No more guessing who owes you.

00:00:42.877 --> 00:00:43.509
Lesson Ledger.

00:00:43.529 --> 00:00:46.109
Record every lesson and see what is pending.

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:50.211
Know who has paid you, without the notebook.

